  "solution": "Given equation: 320 × 4 − 16 ÷ 4 + 2 = 18.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) + and −\n\nGiven: 320 × 4 − 16 ÷ 4 + 2 = 18\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get;\n\n⇒ 320 × 4 + __**16 ÷ 4**__ - 2 = 18\n\n⇒ __**320 × 4**__ + 4 - 2 = 18\n\n⇒ __2480** +**____** 4**__ - 2 = 18\n\n⇒ __248____4____** -**____** 2**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 2482 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) **÷ and ×**\n\nGiven: 320 × 4 − 16 ÷ 4 + 2 = 18\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ __**320 ÷ 4**__ − 16 × 4 + 2 = 18\n\n⇒ 80 − __**16 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 2 = 18\n\n⇒ __**80**__ − 64 __**+ 2**__ = 18\n\n⇒ __82 - 64__ = 18\n\n⇒ 18 = 18\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 3) × and −\n\nGiven: 320 × 4 − 16 ÷ 4 + 2 = 18\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 320 - 4 × __**16 ÷ 4**__ + 2 = 18\n\n⇒ 320 - __**4 **____**× **____64__ + 2 = 18\n\n⇒ __**320**__ - 256 __**+ 2**__ = 18\n\n⇒ __322** - **____**256**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 66 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) × and +\n\nGiven: 320 × 4 − 16 ÷ 4 + 2 = 18\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 320 + 4 − __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 2 = 18\n\n⇒ 320 + 4 − __**4 × 2**__ = 18\n\n⇒ __**320 + 4**__ − 8 = 18\n\n⇒ __324** − **____**8**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 316 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
